[Icon Theme]
Name=Hibana
Comment=hibana's icons for paw: horned folders, places and applications in ash and ember, drawn with Codex; everything else from Tela-hibana
Inherits=Tela-hibana-black-dark,Papirus-Dark,Adwaita,hicolor
Example=folder
Directories=256x256/apps,256x256/places,256x256/devices,128x128/apps,128x128/places,128x128/devices,64x64/apps,64x64/places,64x64/devices,48x48/apps,48x48/places,48x48/devices,32x32/apps,32x32/places,32x32/devices,24x24/apps,24x24/places,24x24/devices,16x16/apps,16x16/places,16x16/devices

